{
  "title": "About Podcast Plugin",
  "story": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "id": "0259f9525714715f",
      "text": "The Podcast Plugin turns a podcast link into wiki pages. Paste or drop any podcast link — a feed, a BBC Sounds or programme page, Apple Podcasts, ListenNotes, a show's website — or type a title. The farm finds the podcast's open RSS feed, and from it builds a podcast page or an episode page, shown as a ghost page to fork."
    },
    {
      "type": "podcast",
      "id": "b27e0b53d04398b5",
      "text": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/sounds/play/m00331n6"
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "id": "7ce6ffe548e6d229",
      "text": "# Why The Feed\n> Open access, so the audio can be kept."
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "id": "2987f63e7d757000",
      "text": "A ListenNotes or player link depends on that service. The feed is the publisher's own list of episodes and audio files, so the pages play straight from it and can later archive the audio."
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "id": "6b3b0a9d2e29972e",
      "text": "# Item Text\n> All optional; double-click the item's edge to edit."
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "id": "7b935d25307f19b2",
      "text": "- the first line prefills the box: a link or a title\n- TITLE: a podcast title, when the link is a site that carries several podcasts\n- RECENT: how many recent episodes the podcast page lists (default 10)"
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "id": "47dfb466f068bc8e",
      "text": "# Who May Use It\n> The owner, on a private site."
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "id": "31c03b91e18815dd",
      "text": "Finding a feed reaches the public internet and spends the farm's ListenNotes quota, so the farm answers only the site's signed-in owner, only on a private site, and never offers it to agents. Links that point at private addresses (the farm itself, the home network, the tailnet) are refused."
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "id": "da2814ae45399c18",
      "text": "# See\n- [[Podcast Plugin Plan]]"
    }
  ],
